---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { withBase } from '../utils/withBase';
---

<BaseLayout title="Committee" description="Meet the Metford Cobras FC committee and find out how to get involved with our community-run club.">
	<section class="container-page py-10 md:py-14">
		<p class="kicker">Club</p>
		<h1 class="page-title">Meet the Cobras Committee</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-700">
			Metford Cobras FC is proudly community-run. Every training session, game day, fundraiser, field setup, and club improvement happens because volunteers step forward to help.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-700">
			We are a growing club with a passionate committee, but we are always looking for more people to get involved &#8212; even in small ways. Whether you have football experience or not, there&#8217;s a place for you here.
		</p>

		<!-- Current committee -->
		<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Current committee</h2>

		<div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">

			<div class="card flex gap-4">
				<img src={withBase('/assets/committee/mitch.png')} alt="Mitchell Barwick" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-cobra-blue/10" loading="lazy" />
				<div>
					<p class="kicker">President &amp; Treasurer</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Mitchell Barwick</p>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Provides overall leadership and direction for the club, and manages club finances, payments, budgeting, and financial reporting.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="card flex gap-4">
				<img src={withBase('/assets/committee/jaz.png')} alt="Jasmine Callan" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-cobra-blue/10" loading="lazy" />
				<div>
					<p class="kicker">Secretary &amp; Registrar</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Jasmine Callan</p>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Handles club administration, communications, and official correspondence. Also coordinates player registrations, team allocations, and PlayFootball administration.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="card flex gap-4">
				<img src={withBase('/assets/committee/candice.png')} alt="Candice Barwick" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-cobra-blue/10" loading="lazy" />
				<div>
					<p class="kicker">Canteen Coordinator</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Candice Barwick</p>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Oversees canteen operations, stock, volunteers, and game day food service.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="card flex gap-4">
				<img src={withBase('/assets/committee/toni.png')} alt="Toni Barwick" class="h-16 w-16 shrink-0 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-cobra-blue/10" loading="lazy" />
				<div>
					<p class="kicker">General Committee</p>
					<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Toni Barwick</p>
					<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Supports club operations across a variety of areas and assists wherever needed throughout the season.</p>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>

		<!-- Volunteer positions -->
		<h2 class="mt-12 text-xl font-medium text-slate-900">Volunteer positions available</h2>
		<p class="mt-2 max-w-2xl text-sm text-slate-700">
			These roles are incredibly important to helping our club continue to grow sustainably. You do not need previous committee experience &#8212; just reliability, communication, and a willingness to help.
		</p>

		<div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0 md:col-span-2">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Vice President</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Vice President</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Supports the President and helps oversee club operations, projects, and volunteers.</p>
				<div class="mt-4 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
					<div>
						<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">What the role involves</p>
						<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Assisting with club coordination</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Supporting volunteers and committee members</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping with match day operations and projects</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Stepping in when the President is unavailable</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div>
						<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
						<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Is organised and approachable</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Enjoys helping teams work together</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Wants to contribute without taking on everything themselves</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Grounds &amp; Facilities</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Grounds / Facilities Coordinator</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Helps keep our grounds match-ready and organised.</p>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Responsibilities</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Assisting with field setup and pack down</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Coordinating line marking and goals</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping manage storage sheds and equipment areas</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Reporting maintenance issues</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Likes practical, hands-on work</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Enjoys being outdoors</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Wants to directly improve the match day experience</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Equipment</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Equipment / Gear Steward</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Keeps track of club equipment and helps ensure teams have what they need.</p>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Responsibilities</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Managing jerseys, balls, bibs, cones, and first aid kits</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Tracking stock and replacements</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping organise equipment distribution</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Is organised and reliable</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Likes systems and keeping things tidy</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Wants a role that can mostly happen behind the scenes</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Sponsorship &amp; Fundraising</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Sponsorship &amp; Fundraising Coordinator</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Helps grow the club through partnerships and fundraising initiatives.</p>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Responsibilities</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Contacting local businesses for sponsorship opportunities</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Coordinating fundraising events and activities</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping identify new revenue opportunities for the club</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Enjoys community connections</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Is confident communicating with local businesses</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Has ideas and enthusiasm for helping the club grow</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">Note: this role does not manage social media.</p>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Team Officials</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Team Official Coordinator</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Supports the people who support our players &#8212; helping coordinate coaches, managers, referees, and game leaders so every team is organised and set up for success.</p>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Responsibilities</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Coordinating club referees and game leaders</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Supporting coaches and team managers throughout the season</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping ensure every team has the required officials in place</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Acting as a communication link between team officials and the committee</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Enjoys helping and organising people</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Communicates clearly and positively</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Is approachable and supportive</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">A great role for someone who wants to contribute without needing to coach a team directly.</p>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Refereeing</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Club Referee</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Club referees are paid volunteers who step in when official referees are unavailable &#8212; keeping games running and giving players the match day experience they deserve.</p>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">What&#8217;s involved</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Officiating matches when the assigned referee is unavailable</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Applying the laws of the game fairly and consistently</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping create a safe and enjoyable environment for all players</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-3">
					<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
					<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Has a good understanding of football and its rules</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Is confident, calm, and fair under pressure</li>
						<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Wants to stay involved in the game without playing</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">This is a paid volunteer role. Training is provided and fully covered by the club.</p>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

			<div class="card border-2 border-dashed border-slate-200 ring-0 md:col-span-2">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
					<p class="kicker">Member Protection</p>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-emerald-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-700">Available</span>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Member Protection Information Officer (MPIO)</p>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Supports a safe, respectful, and inclusive environment for all members.</p>
				<div class="mt-4 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
					<div>
						<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Responsibilities</p>
						<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Acting as a contact point for welfare or conduct concerns</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Supporting respectful behaviour and club values</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Helping direct members toward appropriate processes when needed</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div>
						<p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Ideal for someone who</p>
						<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-sm text-slate-700">
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Is approachable and trustworthy</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Communicates calmly and respectfully</li>
							<li class="flex gap-2"><span class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-cobra-blue">&#8594;</span>Cares about creating a positive club culture</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-3 text-xs text-slate-500">Training and guidance can be provided for this role.</p>
				<a class="mt-4 btn-secondary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Express interest &#8594;</a>
			</div>

		</div>

		<!-- CTA -->
		<div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl bg-cobra-yellow p-5">
			<p class="kicker">Want to help?</p>
			<h2 class="mt-2 text-lg font-medium text-cobra-blue">Community clubs survive because people step forward.</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-cobra-blue/80">
				If you&#8217;d like to get involved &#8212; even if you&#8217;re unsure which role suits you &#8212; please reach out to the committee. Every bit of help makes a difference.
			</p>
			<a class="mt-4 btn-primary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Get in touch</a>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-4 card">
			<h2 class="text-base font-medium text-slate-900">Contact the committee</h2>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-700">Use the club contact details and we&#8217;ll route your message to the right person.</p>
			<a class="mt-4 btn-primary" href={withBase('/contact-us')}>Contact Us</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>
